  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/10/IMG_2149.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Ayuntamiento de Onda ha celebrado este mediod&iacute;a el 9 d&#39;Octubre con m&uacute;sica de la banda de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia, izada de banderas por personal de Protecci&oacute;n Civil, discurso del alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos, canto del himno por&nbsp;Arcadio Mart&iacute; Saura, traca y bailes tradicionales del Grup Folkl&ograve;ric d&#39;Onda en el Raval de Sant Josep.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2102.jpg\" alt=\"img_2102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2103.jpg\" alt=\"img_2103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2104.jpg\" alt=\"img_2104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2105.jpg\" alt=\"img_2105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2106.jpg\" alt=\"img_2106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2107.jpg\" alt=\"img_2107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2108.jpg\" alt=\"img_2108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2109.jpg\" alt=\"img_2109\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/9octubre13onda/img_2110.jpg\" alt=\"img_2110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto